* ''Many floors, innermost first'' (operator, 2026-11-12: //"Pono, approve both leans (many floors, Kahu seats)."//). A vessel that stands in several Nexuses holds one floor pin per Nexus, and its recipe stacks those floors innermost-first: its Household's canon shadows the Crossroads', which shadows the Temple's, with the planetary floor beneath; the top layer shadows across tiers as it does within one (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/w26-floor-lane#/many-floors`>>). Owed: no recipe stacks more than one floor yet (#/the-leaps).

